(7030804, 1067835, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lately Macro has my fascination  but it''s allot harder than simply enlarging and getting close. Stunning example of good comp and background. Nicely done. I know D.O.F Is much tougher than you think but would have liked to see that body in focus as well but mayeb it helps to draw the eyes to the left and head/legs together with the general comp lines running right to left and down. 9</td>', 'Lately Macro has my fascination  but it''s allot harder than simply enlarging and getting close. Stunning example of good comp and background. Nicely done. I know D.O.F Is much tougher than you think but would have liked to see that body in focus as well but mayeb it helps to draw the eyes to the left and head/legs together with the general comp lines running right to left and down. 9', '2013-05-02 06:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
