(7031346, 1067781, 110108, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2013-05-03 04:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031347, 1067738, 109341, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the tone mapped processing in this shot, the exposure does not seem balanced. The swans are all but lost (to be honest I didn''t even notice them at first) in the underexposed shadows on the right side of the frame (especially sad since they are in your title and should be featured in the shot).   I gave this a 3 initially, now upgrading to a 4.</td>', 'I don''t like the tone mapped processing in this shot, the exposure does not seem balanced. The swans are all but lost (to be honest I didn''t even notice them at first) in the underexposed shadows on the right side of the frame (especially sad since they are in your title and should be featured in the shot).   I gave this a 3 initially, now upgrading to a 4.', '2013-05-03 04:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031349, 1064095, 109341, '<td valign="top">Poorly exposed.  Sky and man''s nose and cheeks are blown out.  Framing is distracting and composition of the subject in the middle is rather boring.  Eye contact is the only positive I see here and that upgraded the shot from 2 to 3 for my vote.</td>', 'Poorly exposed.  Sky and man''s nose and cheeks are blown out.  Framing is distracting and composition of the subject in the middle is rather boring.  Eye contact is the only positive I see here and that upgraded the shot from 2 to 3 for my vote.', '2013-05-03 04:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031350, 1066263, 109341, '<td valign="top">Yes, another poorly exposed cat portrait.  Proper exposure with no frame may have received a 4 or 5 from me, but a blown out eye which is the focal point of the shot is unforgivable....3</td>', 'Yes, another poorly exposed cat portrait.  Proper exposure with no frame may have received a 4 or 5 from me, but a blown out eye which is the focal point of the shot is unforgivable....3', '2013-05-03 04:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031351, 1067907, 109341, '<td valign="top">Decent exposure and crop but not feeling much else from this image.  The subject doesn''t hold my attention and the parrallell lines of bamboo, lead the eye away from the frame. 4</td>', 'Decent exposure and crop but not feeling much else from this image.  The subject doesn''t hold my attention and the parrallell lines of bamboo, lead the eye away from the frame. 4', '2013-05-03 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031352, 1067957, 109341, '<td valign="top">This had a potential for a decent abstract, but sharp details in certain parts and distracting large branch on bottom left corner ruined it for me.  3</td>', 'This had a potential for a decent abstract, but sharp details in certain parts and distracting large branch on bottom left corner ruined it for me.  3', '2013-05-03 04:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031353, 1067782, 109341, '<td valign="top">It''s one poorly exposed rock....3</td>', 'It''s one poorly exposed rock....3', '2013-05-03 04:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031354, 1067937, 109341, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting + lack of connection with the subject = boring image = 3</td>', 'Poor lighting + lack of connection with the subject = boring image = 3', '2013-05-03 04:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031355, 1066740, 109341, '<td valign="top">Amputated leg, lack of face /connection / eexpression / emotion of child, = dull snapshot.  I''m afraid this one is a 3 from me.</td>', 'Amputated leg, lack of face /connection / eexpression / emotion of child, = dull snapshot.  I''m afraid this one is a 3 from me.', '2013-05-03 04:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031356, 1066689, 109341, '<td valign="top">This location has amazing potential....sadly it was not captured in this image.   Your biggest problem here is time of day.  You clearly shot this mid-day in full bright sun and in the process created extremely harsh contrast and shadows, not to mention overexposed the white rocks in the foreground. The black bush a branch, twig /pipe in the lower left corner take the eye immidiately away from the rest of the image and focus it there on the "pseudo shovel".  You also overexposed the beach on the other side of the bank.  Complete lack of clouds in the sky make it also a bit dull.  I would highly suggest (if you can of course) getting to this location eaither during ealry morning or late afternoon and shoot it during the golden hour.  Perhaps try some ND filters and some slower exposure.  The way it stands, can''t do more than a 3.  Sorry.</td>', 'This location has amazing potential....sadly it was not captured in this image.   Your biggest problem here is time of day.  You clearly shot this mid-day in full bright sun and in the process created extremely harsh contrast and shadows, not to mention overexposed the white rocks in the foreground. The black bush a branch, twig /pipe in the lower left corner take the eye immidiately away from the rest of the image and focus it there on the "pseudo shovel".  You also overexposed the beach on the other side of the bank.  Complete lack of clouds in the sky make it also a bit dull.  I would highly suggest (if you can of course) getting to this location eaither during ealry morning or late afternoon and shoot it during the golden hour.  Perhaps try some ND filters and some slower exposure.  The way it stands, can''t do more than a 3.  Sorry.', '2013-05-03 04:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031357, 1067799, 109341, '<td valign="top">If you nailed the exposure, it could have been better.  In this shape it''s a 4</td>', 'If you nailed the exposure, it could have been better.  In this shape it''s a 4', '2013-05-03 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031358, 1067703, 109341, '<td valign="top">Great idea ruined by poor execution.  I hate....hate...HATE the black blob at the top of the frame.  Why on earth would you not crop it out?? It''s so distracting from the rest of the composition.  Exposure here is tricky but that is where advanced editing comes in handy.  Shadow, which is the subject of your image is grossly understated and lost in the bright squares and the geometric designs.  Points for composition but negatives for poor crop and poor exposure. 4</td>', 'Great idea ruined by poor execution.  I hate....hate...HATE the black blob at the top of the frame.  Why on earth would you not crop it out?? It''s so distracting from the rest of the composition.  Exposure here is tricky but that is where advanced editing comes in handy.  Shadow, which is the subject of your image is grossly understated and lost in the bright squares and the geometric designs.  Points for composition but negatives for poor crop and poor exposure. 4', '2013-05-03 04:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031445, 1062657, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an almost 3-D quality.  I love those sweet faces :) 7</td>', 'This has an almost 3-D quality.  I love those sweet faces :) 7', '2013-05-03 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1);
