(7031912, 1065235, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hello Biscayne Bay.  :)<br/> <br/>I see they opened up the waterfront on Watson again, that''s awesome, this is a great place to shoot.  Once the sidewalk is finished (is it?) then just a bit up the causeway bridge is even better.<br/> <br/>So, the shot is very nice, love what you did with the foreground water, and the water in general here.  Nice tones, but the reds/yellows are over saturated.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks for this, the causeway over to the Beach makes me smile - I drove this every day for years. :)  It''s one of the things I miss the most about living there.</td>', 'Hello Biscayne Bay.  :) I see they opened up the waterfront on Watson again, that''s awesome, this is a great place to shoot.  Once the sidewalk is finished (is it?) then just a bit up the causeway bridge is even better. So, the shot is very nice, love what you did with the foreground water, and the water in general here.  Nice tones, but the reds/yellows are over saturated.   Anyway, thanks for this, the causeway over to the Beach makes me smile - I drove this every day for years. :)  It''s one of the things I miss the most about living there.', '2013-05-04 12:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
