(7033499, 1066717, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot!</td>', 'Fabulous shot!', '2013-05-07 09:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033501, 1067779, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very 70''s Agfa Slide film blue/grey in the sky and dullish browns. Lovely image specifically PP to give me the feel of Nat Geo Mag in the 70''s.</td>', 'Very 70''s Agfa Slide film blue/grey in the sky and dullish browns. Lovely image specifically PP to give me the feel of Nat Geo Mag in the 70''s.', '2013-05-07 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033507, 1063667, 124190, '<td valign="top">Damn. That spell is potent.     Froze me right up.   Have to cook up an antecedent reverse spell pronto.   Thanks for the challenge.   ;-).     I haven''t worn a skull on my head yet.....hmmm..... new idea.... goes to show you, once again, a good looking witch can wear a burlap bag or skull on her head and still look *good* (???).  If I did, it would just look.....like a witch.......and people may find me...... frightening.   This should SO be on the cover of "Wiccan Wogue"!!!     Tttteeeeeeeehhhhhh nnnnnnnn.   Shiver me timbers I voted 10.   Your spell worked.</td>', 'Damn. That spell is potent.     Froze me right up.   Have to cook up an antecedent reverse spell pronto.   Thanks for the challenge.   ;-).     I haven''t worn a skull on my head yet.....hmmm..... new idea.... goes to show you, once again, a good looking witch can wear a burlap bag or skull on her head and still look *good* (???).  If I did, it would just look.....like a witch.......and people may find me...... frightening.   This should SO be on the cover of "Wiccan Wogue"!!!     Tttteeeeeeeehhhhhh nnnnnnnn.   Shiver me timbers I voted 10.   Your spell worked.', '2013-05-07 09:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033511, 1067737, 124190, '<td valign="top">Best in show.</td>', 'Best in show.', '2013-05-07 09:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033609, 1066158, 82999, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped it to place the butterfly slightly to the left and changed the title.  Flight, for example.  Otherwise an excellent image.</td>', 'I would have cropped it to place the butterfly slightly to the left and changed the title.  Flight, for example.  Otherwise an excellent image.', '2013-05-07 13:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033627, 1067880, 28427, '<td valign="top">These beautiful twins (as I call them) are already known by the most of us.  However, each time you show us a different portrait of them and we (at least I) get never bored when seeing them.  Beautiful details, great colour.</td>', 'These beautiful twins (as I call them) are already known by the most of us.  However, each time you show us a different portrait of them and we (at least I) get never bored when seeing them.  Beautiful details, great colour.', '2013-05-07 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033672, 1062657, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, super intimate image.  Nasty dust bunnies, and some degradation in the sunset background that you need to revisit - and this image is worth revisiting.</td>', 'Lovely composition, super intimate image.  Nasty dust bunnies, and some degradation in the sunset background that you need to revisit - and this image is worth revisiting.', '2013-05-07 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033677, 1068018, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition and you have, indeed, posed your model well ;p<br/>I think you may have been able to push your sharpening  a bit more - might be worth trying.</td>', 'Super composition and you have, indeed, posed your model well ;pI think you may have been able to push your sharpening  a bit more - might be worth trying.', '2013-05-07 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033679, 1067981, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice kittie!  A really bizarre image, that makes you look twice!  Clearly not a good time of day, with very harsh light, but moments like this don''t come along often.  Possibly a fraction over-sharpened?  A shallower dof may also have been beneficial, but might not have been possible given the amount of light.</td>', 'Nice kittie!  A really bizarre image, that makes you look twice!  Clearly not a good time of day, with very harsh light, but moments like this don''t come along often.  Possibly a fraction over-sharpened?  A shallower dof may also have been beneficial, but might not have been possible given the amount of light.', '2013-05-07 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033680, 1066747, 67258, '<td valign="top">Strangely appealing.</td>', 'Strangely appealing.', '2013-05-07 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033686, 1067659, 67258, '<td valign="top">Radiant, indeed.  A Spring image to bring a smile.  a shame about the blown highlights in the front tips, but super detail in both petals and flower center.  May have benefited from either more or less of the background showing.  I find the very small amounts of purple somewhat distracting rather than complimentary - just need a little more.  Love the subtle shadows.</td>', 'Radiant, indeed.  A Spring image to bring a smile.  a shame about the blown highlights in the front tips, but super detail in both petals and flower center.  May have benefited from either more or less of the background showing.  I find the very small amounts of purple somewhat distracting rather than complimentary - just need a little more.  Love the subtle shadows.', '2013-05-07 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033687, 1064113, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gosh - I am somewhat at a loss for words!</td>', 'Gosh - I am somewhat at a loss for words!', '2013-05-07 15:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033689, 1067932, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a stunning sunset - who would have thought a concrete pier could look so appealing? Lovely.</td>', 'What a stunning sunset - who would have thought a concrete pier could look so appealing? Lovely.', '2013-05-07 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033691, 1067782, 83313, '<td valign="top">Iz rock garden of Grog. Much zen grows in garden. Iz calm place for grog to reflect on meaning of life before killing enemies in glorious battle.</td>', 'Iz rock garden of Grog. Much zen grows in garden. Iz calm place for grog to reflect on meaning of life before killing enemies in glorious battle.', '2013-05-07 15:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033692, 1067763, 67258, '<td valign="top">A tad over-sharpened, but what a wonderful display of synchronicity.</td>', 'A tad over-sharpened, but what a wonderful display of synchronicity.', '2013-05-07 15:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033693, 1064067, 67258, '<td valign="top">The eyes seem a little over-processed to me, but a lovely photo nonetheless.</td>', 'The eyes seem a little over-processed to me, but a lovely photo nonetheless.', '2013-05-07 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033694, 1068066, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Soothing colors and textures.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Soothing colors and textures.', '2013-05-07 15:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033698, 1066804, 67258, '<td valign="top">Really like the photo of the flower, but less convinced by the inclusion of the floral decorated mirror.</td>', 'Really like the photo of the flower, but less convinced by the inclusion of the floral decorated mirror.', '2013-05-07 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033699, 1067618, 67258, '<td valign="top">A little over-sharpened in my view, but a good composition and interesting scene.</td>', 'A little over-sharpened in my view, but a good composition and interesting scene.', '2013-05-07 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033700, 1067870, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft, romantic image with a fairy-tale feel.  I love the way it is framed to give the viewer the feeling of peaking in on a newly discovered scene.</td>', 'Lovely soft, romantic image with a fairy-tale feel.  I love the way it is framed to give the viewer the feeling of peaking in on a newly discovered scene.', '2013-05-07 15:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033707, 1067305, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely composition!</td>', 'What a lovely composition!', '2013-05-07 15:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033710, 1067610, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super, strong mono conversion.</td>', 'Super, strong mono conversion.', '2013-05-07 15:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033714, 1067781, 67258, '<td valign="top">A little over sharpened for my tastes, but nonetheless a lovely photo.</td>', 'A little over sharpened for my tastes, but nonetheless a lovely photo.', '2013-05-07 15:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033716, 1066717, 67258, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2013-05-07 15:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033719, 1067733, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, subtle landscape - clearly carefully composed to make the most of that wonderful light</td>', 'Beautiful, subtle landscape - clearly carefully composed to make the most of that wonderful light', '2013-05-07 15:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033720, 1067613, 67258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely super nature study.</td>', 'Absolutely super nature study.', '2013-05-07 15:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033722, 1067835, 67258, '<td valign="top">For this arachnophobe to give a vote of 7 to a photo of a spider is saying something.  Despite the fact that is clearly a really good photo, I am not going to linger longer...</td>', 'For this arachnophobe to give a vote of 7 to a photo of a spider is saying something.  Despite the fact that is clearly a really good photo, I am not going to linger longer...', '2013-05-07 15:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033723, 1068001, 11769, '<td valign="top">every pane has a story to tell</td>', 'every pane has a story to tell', '2013-05-07 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7033724, 1067833, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this - reminds me of the market days of my childhood growing up in the Yorkshire Dales.</td>', 'Oh, I love this - reminds me of the market days of my childhood growing up in the Yorkshire Dales.', '2013-05-07 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
