(7033871, 1066227, 65234, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite Sprng flowers.  Such great structure.  This one has nice variegated color on the petals, too.  Nicely detailed.</td>', 'One of my favorite Sprng flowers.  Such great structure.  This one has nice variegated color on the petals, too.  Nicely detailed.', '2013-05-07 19:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
