(7033891, 1067012, 83313, '<td valign="top">Thag summons wind spirits to always be at back of Grog when Grog ride fast rolly-thing. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1001214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Works until Grog turn around other direction.</td>', 'Thag summons wind spirits to always be at back of Grog when Grog ride fast rolly-thing.   Works until Grog turn around other direction.', '2013-05-07 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
