(7034146, 1067799, 30982, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W (toned) works so very well here to show off the patterning in the bird.  Lovely bokeh, too!</td>', 'B&W (toned) works so very well here to show off the patterning in the bird.  Lovely bokeh, too!', '2013-05-08 00:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
