(7034166, 1067665, 75618, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really beautiful. What <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=43774" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">KarenNfld</a> doesn''t like about this image is what makes this stand out IMO. The processing is spot-on, retro without looking overdone. The vulnerable expression is a wonderful contrast to her "tough" exterior. Gave you an 8 but meant to bump it to 9.</td>', 'I thought this was really beautiful. What  KarenNfld doesn''t like about this image is what makes this stand out IMO. The processing is spot-on, retro without looking overdone. The vulnerable expression is a wonderful contrast to her "tough" exterior. Gave you an 8 but meant to bump it to 9.', '2013-05-08 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
