(7034264, 1065457, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Hussar1812:</b></div><hr/><i> The frame behind his head is VERY distracting.    Image would be much stronger with a plain background.  Also, way too much vignetting creating too big of a contrast for a portrait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for taking time to comment, it is appreciated.<br/> <br/>I agree the frame is distracting and I tried to hide it as much as I could - hence the vignetting. This was not a posed shot it was a quick snap I took whilst at his younger brothers birthday. I would like to take some photos of Declan in a controlled environment but until then I will have to make do with what I take these days - snaps.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Hussar1812: The frame behind his head is VERY distracting.    Image would be much stronger with a plain background.  Also, way too much vignetting creating too big of a contrast for a portrait.   Thanks for taking time to comment, it is appreciated. I agree the frame is distracting and I tried to hide it as much as I could - hence the vignetting. This was not a posed shot it was a quick snap I took whilst at his younger brothers birthday. I would like to take some photos of Declan in a controlled environment but until then I will have to make do with what I take these days - snaps. Mike ', '2013-05-08 04:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7034266, 1067916, 20799, '<td valign="top">Superb, underappreciated. Probably one of your best.</td>', 'Superb, underappreciated. Probably one of your best.', '2013-05-08 04:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7034268, 1067737, 20799, '<td valign="top">Very unique. I appreciate your choice of processing, many would have taken a safer road. This is from another time. I wonder where it was taken.</td>', 'Very unique. I appreciate your choice of processing, many would have taken a safer road. This is from another time. I wonder where it was taken.', '2013-05-08 04:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7034270, 1067936, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM, Brent, great view. Taken from "Le Ciel de Paris" (Tour Montparnasse) ?<br/>Hope you had a nice trip!</td>', 'Congrats on the HM, Brent, great view. Taken from "Le Ciel de Paris" (Tour Montparnasse) ?Hope you had a nice trip!', '2013-05-08 04:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7034271, 1067936, 96530, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the HM, Brent, great view. Taken from "Le Ciel de Paris" (Tour Montparnasse) ?<br/>Hope you had a nice trip! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Oliver!  You got the location exactly right ;) Yeah, was a good trip overall- except for the pick pocket getting my wallet part! :P  Wish you and Christiane still lived relatively close to Paris, would love to have been able to meet up with you :)</td>', 'Originally posted by h2: Congrats on the HM, Brent, great view. Taken from "Le Ciel de Paris" (Tour Montparnasse) ?Hope you had a nice trip!  Thanks Oliver!  You got the location exactly right ;) Yeah, was a good trip overall- except for the pick pocket getting my wallet part! :P  Wish you and Christiane still lived relatively close to Paris, would love to have been able to meet up with you :)', '2013-05-08 04:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
