(7034436, 1067936, 96530, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Asainz320:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you shoot a timelapse while you were there in this beautiful scene?! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This was a single five second exposure, but I used a two stop hard graduated neutral density filter above the horizon to keep the highlights in the sky tamed. At this point it was just about time to switch to a one stop filter- if not sooner :P<br/> <br/>ETA- Ah, I understand what you were asking now Alain :) No, this was my first time at this place so I moved about a bit. A time lapse series from day to night in the same position would have been very cool though!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-05-08 12:10:10.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Asainz320: Did you shoot a timelapse while you were there in this beautiful scene?!  This was a single five second exposure, but I used a two stop hard graduated neutral density filter above the horizon to keep the highlights in the sky tamed. At this point it was just about time to switch to a one stop filter- if not sooner :P ETA- Ah, I understand what you were asking now Alain :) No, this was my first time at this place so I moved about a bit. A time lapse series from day to night in the same position would have been very cool though!', '2013-05-08 12:28:50.000000', '2013-05-08 13:10:10.000000', 0),
