(7034739, 1067684, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice bright eye with this, but either the distance, the crop factor, or the editing gave this a bit of a digital/pixelized feel, if that makes sense.  Very good isolation - probably a factor of that massive lens!</td>', 'Nice bright eye with this, but either the distance, the crop factor, or the editing gave this a bit of a digital/pixelized feel, if that makes sense.  Very good isolation - probably a factor of that massive lens!', '2013-05-08 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
