(7034797, 1067684, 109341, '<td valign="top">What I really like is the piercing eye and the profile look!  Unfortunately that''s where it ends.   The bright sunlight completely blew out any detail of the white feathers, the whole aspect of which is arguably made worse through the pseudo-hdr like processing.</td>', 'What I really like is the piercing eye and the profile look!  Unfortunately that''s where it ends.   The bright sunlight completely blew out any detail of the white feathers, the whole aspect of which is arguably made worse through the pseudo-hdr like processing.', '2013-05-09 04:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
