(7048695, 1067936, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I was awaiting to view some of the pics you took :)<br/> <br/>Afterall I didn''t get a chance to go up Tower 56. Eh, till next time. I did really like Paris in the rain. It felt more like October than it did May for most of my time there. Wasn''t expecting it getting dark that late either. About what time was this pic taken?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-06-06 12:25:30.</i></td>', 'Very nice! I was awaiting to view some of the pics you took :) Afterall I didn''t get a chance to go up Tower 56. Eh, till next time. I did really like Paris in the rain. It felt more like October than it did May for most of my time there. Wasn''t expecting it getting dark that late either. About what time was this pic taken?', '2013-06-06 13:24:22.000000', '2013-06-06 13:25:30.000000', 0),
(7048728, 1067936, 96530, '<td valign="top">Thanks Techo :) I''m not at my archives to know for certain what time I took this, but twilight was well underway. I''d say the tower is well worth a visit for next time you are there, just wait for what looks like a promising sunset as I did.<br/> <br/>I still have only maybe a dozen images processed from the trip :P Just been too busy, hope to get to them soon.<br/> <br/>Glad you managed well enough with the weather you had in May. I could not believe my luck in April. It turned to summer the week I was there, and then apparently dipped back into winter the day after I left.</td>', 'Thanks Techo :) I''m not at my archives to know for certain what time I took this, but twilight was well underway. I''d say the tower is well worth a visit for next time you are there, just wait for what looks like a promising sunset as I did. I still have only maybe a dozen images processed from the trip :P Just been too busy, hope to get to them soon. Glad you managed well enough with the weather you had in May. I could not believe my luck in April. It turned to summer the week I was there, and then apparently dipped back into winter the day after I left.', '2013-06-06 14:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
